_blowup as u32,\n252\t                0,                 // start_log_step\n253\t                l_skip as u32 - 1, // end_log_step (inclusive)\n254\t                false,             // coeffs to evals (NOT eval to coeff)\n255\t                false,             // natural order\n256\t            )\n257\t            .map_err(|error| RsCodeMatrixError::MleInterpolateStage2d { error, step: 1 })?;\n258\t        }\n259\t    }\n260\t\n261\t    // Bit-reverse the entire buffer in-place (required for NTT)\n262\t    unsafe {\n263\t        bit_rev(\n264\t            &codewords,\n265\t            &codewords,\n266\t            log_codeword_height as u32,\n267\t            codeword_height as u32,\n268\t            width as u32,\n269\t        )\n270\t        .map_err(RsCodeMatrixError::BitRev)?;\n271\t    }\n272\t\n273\t    // Compute RS codeword via DFT on the smoothly-embedded domain.\n274\t    batch_ntt(\n275\t        &codewords,\n276\t        log_codeword_height as u32,\n277\t        0u32,\n278\t        width as u32,\n279\t        false, // bit-reversal already done\n280\t        false,\n281\t    );\n282\t    let code_matrix = DeviceMatrix::new(Arc::new(codewords), codeword_height, width);\n283\t    mem.emit_metrics();\n284\t\n285\t    Ok(code_matrix)\n286\t}\n287\t\n288\timpl<F, Digest> StackedPcsDataGpu<F, Digest> {\n289\t    /// Returns a view of the specified unstacked matrix in mixed form.\n290\t    ///\n291\t    /// # Notes\n292\t    /// - `width` must be the width of the unstacked matrix.\n293\t    /// - The unstacked matrix may be strided - this must be handled by the caller.\n294\t    pub fn mixed_view<'a>(\n295\t        &'a self,\n296\t        mat_idx: usize,\n297\t        width: usize,\n298\t    ) -> Option<DeviceMatrixView<'a, F>> {\n299\t        if let Some(matrix) = self.matrix.as_ref() {"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012AboZSK1JwAJAuCM1sMiKL","session_id":"9f2238e8-ef27-4ab7-979f-317ec3807970","uuid":"adfa0685-8ccf-4c17-a70b-4dd83f65f6ab","timestamp":"2026